               Factor Infrastructure Operational Script
======================================================================
Usage: ./factor.sh [COMMAND] [OPTIONS]

Container Management:
  start       Start PostgreSQL container
  stop        Stop PostgreSQL container
  restart     Restart PostgreSQL container
  status      Check status of PostgreSQL container
  remove      Remove PostgreSQL container
  logs        View logs for PostgreSQL container
  exec        Interactive shell into PostgreSQL container

Database Operations:
  drop-tables        Drop all objects in public schema
  run-sql -f <file>  Run a specific SQL script file
  run-generated-sql  Run the predefined generated SQL scripts from outputs

Orchestration:
  deploy             Start container, wait for readiness, and run generated SQL
  regenerate         Drop tables and run generated SQL (container must be running)

Maintenance & Utilities:
  clean-all   CRITICAL: Stop/Remove ALL containers, images, and volumes
  help        Show this help message
